Jarrett said this morning that Satan has been defeated, and yet he is flailing, and that causes lots of chaos and destruction.

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:09,000
In our worlds until Jesus returns. The goal of this revelation, this revealing, is to challenge churches that are rebelling against God's kingdom because of the persecution that they're facing.

15
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:20,000
To wake up churches that have become stagnant, that have become compromised, that have kind of found themselves just going with the flow of the current of our culture.

16
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
And if I were to put the American church in any of these categories, that's probably the one that we are most tempted to struggle with, to just go with the flow of what life is all about.

17
